{"time": 1767495943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200082356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“打扰了”推门而入"}
{"time": 1767496333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334169479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看门店"}
{"time": 1767496755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97018614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "铃铛被推开的门沿轻触，不大但清脆的铃声在这不大而沉闷的店铺中相当抓耳，但未能吸引坐在台后的老板娘。女人身着花一般粉嫩的泡泡袖连衣裙，套着真丝手套的手背撑着下巴，挺俏的鼻尖上，石榴石般的眼瞳中印着那方落地窗裁下的天空之塔的半截。"}
{"time": 1767496868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770066545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门店中除了柜台外还有两张桌子，都摆着一面装饰华丽的银镜。两侧的壁柜上爬着花藤，上面摆着各色的药水罐和精细的首饰"}
{"time": 1767496906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374799208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对方不开口的话似乎有些不好说什么，看了看伊恩，转身去看看首饰和药水罐"}
{"time": 1767496961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556251972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟上舒茉，感觉先买点什么的话 应该更好交流一些"}
{"time": 1767497359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955971494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少第一声的时候她还没回过神来。货架上的东西不曾标注价格。首饰看起来对裁切的使用相当克制，尽可能地展示着天然的雕饰。药水倒是直白地把功能写在上面，从元素亲和、魔力恢复这类魔法师之友到驻颜、灵视之类的杂效都有。"}
{"time": 1767497429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781906657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"炼金...首饰?\"眨了眨眼，侧过脑袋对伊恩小声开口，\"原来是分开的吗？\""}
{"time": 1767497464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424011790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是分开的啊（））"}
{"time": 1767497508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530579400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "魔力恢复感觉好像还不错“是啊，我一开始也以为是一起的”小声，然后拿起一瓶魔力恢复药水“姐姐，这个怎么卖”"}
{"time": 1767497694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315753293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对首饰倒是没什么特别的兴趣，视线跟着看向老板娘"}
{"time": 1767498132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323743829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，公主病要怎么rp）"}
{"time": 1767498248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276163765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（问问伊神（）"}
{"time": 1767498288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577729376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(尬黑，我也没rp过公主病，没吧？)"}
{"time": 1767498445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699607714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "瓶中的液体是海一般的蓝色，罗莉安这才从自己的思绪中回到现实，清了清嗓子“什么时候溜进来的？怎么都不和我问好。这种一瓶60银币，够你分五次喝了”"}
{"time": 1767498528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358244523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "似乎买一瓶也不亏的样子?不过不太清楚功效的话...\"下午好。\"先打个招呼"}
{"time": 1767498634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2141693639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“下午好，姐姐..”虽然自己进门其实已经喊了一声，不过还是不计较这些了"}
{"time": 1767498811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654571743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "再拿一瓶，一共两瓶魔力恢复药水去前台结账"}
{"time": 1767498959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682606473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎”她摇了摇头，叹气中莫名有一种恨铁不成钢的意思。不过表情中的些许郁闷又不完全来自面前的你们。不过视线还是在瞥天空之城之余多看了你们两眼“咦，衣服的款式不错，就是保养得不太好。你们从哪里买的？”"}
{"time": 1767499119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804724169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"东边的一家衣店...\"拎了拎裙摆，\"保养?嗯...有什么问题吗？姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1767499214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146502047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我衣服是不是）"}
{"time": 1767499222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337824009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还是当初在路边买的）"}
{"time": 1767499324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394940217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“洗了之后直接放在火边烘了吧？还没用好的香皂”她的目光主要还是留在舒茉身上"}
{"time": 1767499336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051247415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是买了新衣服吗)"}
{"time": 1767499338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042159279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这次怎么没有讨价还价））"}
{"time": 1767499379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026350589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（又不是所有东西都要讨价还价（）"}
{"time": 1767499456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693716649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "仔细回想，好像确实没有打理过衣物的清洁，\"嗯...\"沉声点点头，\"一般...也足够了吧？\"低头看看衣服有没有什么变化"}
{"time": 1767499533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118153199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那姐姐这里有卖好的香皂吗”四周观望一下，香皂应该也算炼金的范畴吧，不太确定"}
{"time": 1767499550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "903984100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "多少有点发硬。昨晚雨夜越野多少有些伤衣服。不过不知道是不是本身用料优秀，倒是没什么刮擦的痕迹"}
{"time": 1767499786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159871155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然没有了”她收了钱，喃喃自语到“难道审美的新浪潮，这次是从赫顿玛尔开始吗？”"}
{"time": 1767499872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891492522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "捏了捏裙子试图打松一些，试了一下干脆停了手，\"保养得好像是不太好...\"语气稍稍有些低落，不过旋即被她的话吸引，\"审美?新浪潮?嗯...姐姐在说什么？\""}
{"time": 1767499918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171844135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（敬请见证）"}
{"time": 1767499924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910768862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（敬请见证）"}
{"time": 1767499933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3570153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么不是 拭目以待）"}
{"time": 1767500054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45989638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为这是鸣潮的梗）"}
{"time": 1767500079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130968490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A13F119099A35A0F4A75F29005E983A4.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSj0c5_XpCeZu1ISFoakLAQbo804hjQswMg_woovMWp8oLxkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQLTqvisXpk40OJ1m7wbMLy3oCt1aCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMArZMDSTXF1WBwiTo_73iEcVHrhpuJJsGO91P3L534GaZ-3592VNjytskaXLz4q_oQ,file_size=55760]"}
{"time": 1767500101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201248847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(敬请见证，新浪潮)"}
{"time": 1767500107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138761490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(远坂凛说的)"}
{"time": 1767500151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031941864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（拭目以待是 外交部说的（bushi））"}
{"time": 1767500257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730046456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不重要，再怎么新浪潮也不是现在值得让我动脑筋的事情”她摇头，又把目光转向窗外"}
{"time": 1767500290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834383254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "说来粉色其实是相当幼齿的颜色，在她身上居然不怎么显得违和"}
{"time": 1767500371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564871311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"姐姐在看那个塔吗？\"反正自己和伊恩是来等人的，慢慢聊聊天就好。"}
{"time": 1767500520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394479070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这还用问？”"}
{"time": 1767500590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951538884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有什么特别的吗？\""}
{"time": 1767500615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101242860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "总感觉好像走到哪里哪里就会出事，oh不对，赫顿玛尔好像没有出事，摇摇头“从天上掉下来已经很特别了吧”"}
{"time": 1767500834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889743671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（从哪看来都很特别吧（）"}
{"time": 1767500932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876136656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己不是这个意思，或者，\"呃...\"其实是想听听独属于萝莉安的意见，不过此时也不好改口，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1767501020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109594035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那可不是掉下来的，没那么大动静。”她摇头“不过有动作快的冒险家说，里头有很多龙哦？”"}
{"time": 1767501049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873100317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“龙？真的假的”有点想去看看"}
{"time": 1767501139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566230041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎呀”她突然做作地伏在桌上“龙什么的，我也想养一只……但是协会会怎么拒绝我我现在就能想得出来”"}
{"time": 1767501231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388603671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"龙啊...\"虽然有些兴趣，但现在碰见的话倒霉的肯定是自己吧?\"噗。\"看到她的样子一时有些没掩盖住轻笑，偏头看向伊恩，\"确实呢，伊恩什么时候给我抓一只。\""}
{"time": 1767501291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268876521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？...我会努力的”要不偷偷去天空之塔看看，思索ing"}
{"time": 1767501545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878621550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"开个玩笑啦。\"伸手拽住对方的袖子，\"那种地方怎么看都太危险了吧?再说，龙怎么养啦。\""}
{"time": 1767501573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987557830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能....”摇摇头，这种事情自己怎么可能知道"}
{"time": 1767501774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142363946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她看你们没有白帮忙的意思，又撑起身子来“听说塔里的家伙们有大有小。你们是魔法师吧？反正协会最近有9成任务都和那塔有关，你们去的时候顺便帮我弄一只最小的就好了，实在不行蛋也可以~”"}
{"time": 1767501834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774072530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，我们很弱的啊”"}
{"time": 1767501861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375020941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃饭）"}
{"time": 1767501885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878722734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你都要转职了（）"}
{"time": 1767502695, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159329434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"很麻烦诶..\""}
