{"time": 1767615680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12505736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=927477040]不知是心里因素还是什么，感觉似乎比自己的那杯好喝一点，脸也许因为酒精的作用，有点泛红"}
{"time": 1767615712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770357732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"突然反应过来，\"伊恩?\"满脸通红，把脑袋埋进自己的臂弯，\"唔唔...\""}
{"time": 1767616125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357261769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”虽然之前有过更亲密的行为，不过当着叔叔阿姨的面什么的...看着舒茉的样子，感觉心跳忽然就加快了，但强忍镇静"}
{"time": 1767616431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213430793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...嗯...\""}
